-- title:
--   Inertia elements fix places above after separable constant extension
-- statement:
--   Let $\kappa$ be a field and $F$ a field extension of $\kappa$; let $\kappa'$ be a field extension of $\kappa$ that is algebraic and separable over $\kappa$, and let $F'$ be a field that is simultaneously an algebra over $\kappa'$, over $F$ and over $\kappa$, the two scalar towers $\kappa \to F \to F'$ and $\kappa \to \kappa' \to F'$ being compatible. Assume $F'$ is generated by $F$ and the image of $\kappa'$, in the sense that the $F$-subalgebra of $F'$ generated by the range of $\kappa' \to F'$ is all of $F'$. Let $\sigma$ be a $\kappa$-algebra automorphism of $F$ and $\sigma'$ a $\kappa'$-algebra automorphism of $F'$ which restricts to $\sigma$, i.e. $\sigma'(\mathrm{alg}_{F\to F'}(f)) = \mathrm{alg}_{F\to F'}(\sigma f)$ for all $f \in F$. Let $P$ be a place of $F$ over $\kappa$, that is, a valuation subring $\mathcal{O}_P \subseteq F$ containing the image of $\kappa$, different from $F$ itself, and a principal ideal ring. Assume $\sigma \bullet P = P$ for the pointwise action of automorphisms on places, and that $\sigma e - e$ is a non-unit of $\mathcal{O}_P$ for every $e \in \mathcal{O}_P$. Then for every place $P'$ of $F'$ over $\kappa'$ whose valuation subring pulls back along $F \to F'$ to $\mathcal{O}_P$, one has $\sigma' \bullet P' = P'$.
--
--   This is the statement that an element of the inertia group of a place $P$ of $F/\kappa$ — one preserving $\mathcal{O}_P$ and acting trivially on the residue field — fixes each place of $F' = F\cdot\kappa'$ above $P$ after an algebraic separable extension $\kappa'/\kappa$ of the field of constants; an element merely in the decomposition group may instead permute the places above $P$. It is used in the identification of inertia groups at certain places of a two-chart integral model of the modular curves with $\Gamma_0(p)$-structure.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_AlgebraicCurve_Place_smul_eq_of_comap_eq_of_forall_sub_mem_nonunits.lean

